[{"client_msg_id":"d63af531-979c-41e8-91bc-21fdddcaf46a","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"jupyterlabサイドバーのファイルリストってignore設定できます？\nそれだったら楽に済むんですが","ts":"1629375214.021300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/pp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"28B8ECBE-5940-436B-B16D-D56A24BF8D06","type":"message","user":"UP6PA1UBE","text":"git ignore や `'suffixes'` に .pyx を追加してとにかく無視するというソリューション","ts":"1629373615.020000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DOB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"bbdc8aec-5ac7-47dd-b521-e5ce6f19b4e4","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"そうですね","ts":"1629372734.018200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EY7m"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9b81b7d5-3f5a-4bc7-8dc5-50cb6650efcc","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"つまりpyxを生成してるライブラリ側で指定できなきゃ無理ですね。","ts":"1629372713.018000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"5hQg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2112ed0b-7511-4f16-be75-f432991570a4","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"pyx をコンパイルするので、pyx の中にコードが書いてあるはずです。","ts":"1629372315.017000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"24dXx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9f8fbda0-4e43-45ae-8945-c696695f22a5","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"あれいやめっちゃ勘違いしてるな\npyxは生成されるやつじゃないのか\nこれがコンパイルされるコードか","ts":"1629372147.016400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"qDRS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"a9b8fb9c-51c8-4f31-b423-011a63cb0a3e","type":"message","user":"U01D9BALEKU","text":"調べたら普通に変えれそうというかそもそも明示的に指定するやつだな…\n正確に書くと、内部でcython呼んでるライブラリを使っていて、カレントディレクトリがpyxファイルで溢れてしまうので\nPAYTHONPATHみたいなノリで探すor生成するパスを指定できないか、ということです","ts":"1629372110.015400","team":"T03C4RC